1	<!DOCTYPE html>
2	<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
3	<head>
4		<meta charset="utf-8">
5		<meta http-equiv="content-security-policy" content="default-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; img-src data:; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
6		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
7		<meta name="description" content="A well-structured, accessible HTML5 document with modern best practices.">
8		<meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
9		<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
10		<meta name="theme-color" content="#121212" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
11		<meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
12		<title>Welcome</title>
13		<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Ctext y='.9em' font-size='90'%3E👋%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
14		<style>
15			:root {
16				color-scheme: light dark;
17				--text: #1a1a1a;
18				--text-secondary: #555;
19				--background: #fff;
20				--accent: #0052a3;
21				--border: #e0e0e0;
22			}
23			@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
24				:root {
25					--text: #e0e0e0;
26					--text-secondary: #a0a0a0;
27					--background: #121212;
28					--accent: #5fa3ff;
29					--border: #333;
30				}
31			}
32			*,
33			*::before,
34			*::after {
35				box-sizing: border-box;
36			}
37			html {
38				-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
39				text-size-adjust: 100%;
40			}
41			@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
42				html {
43					scroll-behavior: smooth;
44				}
45				a {
46					transition: text-decoration-thickness 0.15s ease;
47				}
48				.skip-link {
49					transition: transform 0.15s ease;
50				}
51				button,
52				.button {
53					transition: opacity 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
54				}
55			}
56			body {
57				display: grid;
58				grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;
59				min-height: 100vh;
60				min-height: 100dvh;
61				font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
62				font-size: 1rem;
63				line-height: 1.6;
64				max-width: 70ch;
65				margin: 0 auto;
66				padding: clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem);
67				padding-top: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-top));
68				padding-right: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-right));
69				padding-bottom: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
70				padding-left: max(clamp(1rem, 5vw, 1.5rem), env(safe-area-inset-left));
71				color: var(--text);
72				background: var(--background);
73			}
74			h1 {
75				color: var(--accent);
76				font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.25rem + 3vw, 2.5rem);
77				font-weight: 700;
78				line-height: 1.1;
79				text-wrap: balance;
80				margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
81				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
82			}
83			h2 {
84				color: var(--accent);
85				font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1.5vw, 1.75rem);
86				font-weight: 600;
87				line-height: 1.2;
88				text-wrap: balance;
89				margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;
90				letter-spacing: -0.01em;
91			}
92			h2:first-child {
93				margin-top: 0;
94			}
95			p {
96				text-wrap: pretty;
97				margin: 1rem 0;
98				line-height: 1.65;
99			}
100			a {
101				color: var(--accent);
102				text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
103				text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
104				text-decoration-skip-ink: auto;
105				font-weight: 500;
106			}
107			a:hover, a:active {
108				text-decoration-thickness: 3px;
109			}
110			button,
111			.button {
112				display: inline-block;
113				text-decoration: none;
114				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
115				font-size: 1rem;
116				font-weight: 500;
117				font-family: inherit;
118				color: var(--background);
119				background: var(--accent);
120				border: 2px solid var(--accent);
121				border-radius: 0.25rem;
122				cursor: pointer;
123				white-space: nowrap;
124			}
125			button:hover,
126			.button:hover {
127				opacity: 0.85;
128				text-decoration: none;
129			}
130			button:active,
131			.button:active {
132				transform: scale(0.97);
133			}
134			ul, ol {
135				margin: 1rem 0;
136				padding-left: 2rem;
137			}
138			li {
139				margin: 0.75rem 0;
140				line-height: 1.6;
141			}
142			:focus-visible {
143				outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
144				outline-offset: 2px;
145				border-radius: 2px;
146			}
147			button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible {
148				box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--background), 0 0 0 5px var(--accent);
149				outline: none;
150			}
151			.skip-link {
152				position: absolute;
153				left: 0;
154				top: 0;
155				transform: translateY(-100%);
156				background: var(--accent);
157				color: var(--background);
158				padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
159				z-index: 1000;
160				border-radius: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
161				font-weight: 600;
162				text-decoration: none;
163				display: inline-block;
164			}
165			.skip-link:focus {
166				transform: none;
167				outline: 3px solid var(--text);
168				outline-offset: -3px;
169			}
170			header {
171				padding-block: 1.5rem 0;
172			}
173			main {
174				padding: 1rem 0;
175			}
176			main:focus {
177				outline: none;
178			}
179			section {
180				margin: 2rem 0;
181			}
182			.card {
183				border: 1px solid var(--border);
184				border-radius: 0.5rem;
185				padding: 1.5rem;
186				background: var(--background);
187				margin: 1.5rem 0;
188			}
189			@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
190				.card {
191					background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
192				}
193			}
194			.card h3 {
195				font-size: 1.25rem;
196				line-height: 1.3;
197				margin-top: 0;
198				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
199				color: var(--accent);
200			}
201			.visually-hidden {
202				position: absolute;
203				width: 1px;
204				height: 1px;
205				margin: -1px;
206				padding: 0;
207				overflow: hidden;
208				clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
209				white-space: nowrap;
210				border: 0;
211			}
212			@media (prefers-contrast: more) {
213				:root {
214					--border: currentColor;
215				}
216				button,
217				.button {
218					border-width: 3px;
219				}
220				.card {
221					border-width: 2px;
222				}
223			}
224			footer {
225				padding-block: 1.5rem;
226				margin-top: auto;
227				border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
228				font-size: 0.875rem;
229				color: var(--text-secondary);
230				text-align: center;
231			}
232			footer p {
233				margin: 0.5rem 0;
234			}
235			small {
236				display: block;
237			}
238			@media print {
239				:root {
240					color-scheme: light;
241					--text: #000;
242					--text-secondary: #333;
243					--background: #fff;
244					--accent: #000;
245					--border: #999;
246				}
247				.skip-link,
248				button,
249				.button {
250					display: none;
251				}
252				body {
253					display: block;
254					min-height: 0;
255					max-width: none;
256					padding: 0;
257				}
258				a {
259					color: inherit;
260					text-decoration: underline;
261				}
262				a[href^="http"]::after {
263					content: " (" attr(href) ")";
264					font-size: 0.85em;
265					font-weight: normal;
266				}
267				.card {
268					border: none;
269					break-inside: avoid;
270				}
271			}
272		</style>
273	</head>
274	<body>
275		<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
276		<header>
277			<h1>Welcome</h1>
278		</header>
279		<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
280			<section>
281				<p>This is a well-structured, accessible HTML5 document demonstrating modern best practices for semantic markup and inclusive design.</p>
282				<p>
283					It uses semantic landmarks, a skip link for keyboard navigation,
284					and CSS that adapts to your light or dark mode preference.
285				</p>
286				<p>
287					Text and link colors meet WCAG AA contrast in both themes, type scales
288					with your browser's font size, and motion respects your system settings.
289				</p>
290			</section>
291	
292			<section aria-labelledby="features">
293				<h2 id="features">Features</h2>
294				<ul>
295					<li>Semantic HTML structure with proper landmarks</li>
296					<li>Keyboard accessible navigation and focus management</li>
297					<li>Dark mode support with custom color schemes</li>
298					<li>Responsive typography using modern CSS</li>
299					<li>Print-friendly styles for better readability</li>
300					<li>WCAG AA contrast compliance in all color modes</li>
301				</ul>
302			</section>
303	
304			<section aria-labelledby="examples">
305				<h2 id="examples">Examples</h2>
306				<article class="card">
307					<h3>Component Cards</h3>
308					<p>Card components are useful for organizing related content. They include a subtle border and padding for visual separation.</p>
309					<a class="button" href="#resources">Learn more<span class="visually-hidden"> about accessibility resources</span></a>
310				</article>
311	
312				<article class="card">
313					<h3>Interactive Elements</h3>
314					<p>Buttons and links are fully accessible with clear focus states. The “Learn more” button above demonstrates smooth transitions and proper visual feedback.</p>
315					<p>Try using the Tab key to navigate through all interactive elements.</p>
316				</article>
317			</section>
318	
319			<section aria-labelledby="resources">
320				<h2 id="resources">Resources</h2>
321				<p>Want to learn more about web accessibility and semantic HTML? Check out these resources:</p>
322				<ul>
323					<li><a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/quickref/">WCAG 2.2 Quick Reference</a></li>
324					<li><a href="https://html.spec.whatwg.org/">HTML Living Standard</a></li>
325					<li><a href="https://www.a11y-101.com/">A11y 101</a></li>
326				</ul>
327			</section>
328		</main>
329		<footer>
330			<p><small>&copy; <time datetime="2026">2026</time>. All rights reserved.</small></p>
331		</footer>
332	</body>
333	</html>
